{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0083-remove-duplicates-from-sorted-list","title":"LeetCode 83 删除排序链表中的重复元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0083-remove-duplicates-from-sorted-list","wordCount":622,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-83-删除排序链表中的重复元素\">LeetCode 83 删除排序链表中的重复元素</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个已排序的链表的头 <code>head</code>，删除所有重复的元素，使每个元素只出现一次。返回已排序的链表。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点数目在范围 <code>[0, 300]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li>题目数据保证链表已经按升序排列</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [1,1,2]&#10;输出：[1,2]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1,1,2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1,2]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [1,1,2,3,3]&#10;输出：[1,2,3]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1,1,2,3,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1,2,3]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是链表版本的&quot;有序去重&quot;，与数组版本（LC #26）的核心思想完全一致——利用有序性，相同元素一定相邻。</p>\n<p><strong>单指针遍历法</strong>是最直接的方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从头节点开始遍历链表</li>\n<li>对于当前节点 <code>current</code>，检查 <code>current.val</code> 是否等于 <code>current.next.val</code></li>\n<li>如果相等，说明下一个节点是重复的，将 <code>current.next</code> 跳过（指向 <code>current.next.next</code>）</li>\n<li>如果不相等，移动 <code>current</code> 到下一个节点</li>\n<li>重复直到链表末尾</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键细节：当发现重复时，我们<strong>不移动 <code>current</code></strong>，因为新的 <code>current.next</code> 可能仍然是重复值（例如 <code>1 → 1 → 1 → 2</code>）。只有当 <code>current.val !== current.next.val</code> 时才前进。</p>\n<p>与数组去重的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>数组去重 (LC #26)</th>\n<th>链表去重 (LC #83)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>连续内存</td>\n<td>链式节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除方式</td>\n<td>覆盖写入</td>\n<td>修改指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要双指针</td>\n<td>是（快慢指针）</td>\n<td>否（单指针即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否释放内存</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>跳过的节点会被 GC 回收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：迭代（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function deleteDuplicates(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  let current = head;&#10;&#10;  while (current !== null &amp;&amp; current.next !== null) {&#10;    if (current.val === current.next.val) {&#10;      current.next = current.next.next;&#10;    } else {&#10;      current = current.next;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return head;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteDuplicates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next.val) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个实现极其简洁。核心逻辑只有一个 <code>if-else</code>：重复则跳过，不重复则前进。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：递归</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function deleteDuplicatesRecursive(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  if (head === null || head.next === null) return head;&#10;&#10;  head.next = deleteDuplicatesRecursive(head.next);&#10;&#10;  return head.val === head.next.val ? head.next : head;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteDuplicatesRecursive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  head.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteDuplicatesRecursive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(head.next);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.next.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>递归版本的思路是：先递归处理 <code>head.next</code> 后面的链表（使其无重复），然后检查 <code>head</code> 是否与处理后的下一个节点重复。如果重复，返回 <code>head.next</code>（跳过当前节点）；否则返回 <code>head</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>迭代</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>单次遍历，原地修改指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>递归栈深度为 n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>迭代方法只需遍历一次链表，每个节点最多被访问一次（即使跳过重复节点，被跳过的节点不会再被访问）。</p>\n<p>本题是链表去重的基础版本。进阶题 LC #82（删除排序链表中的所有重复元素）要求将所有重复值的节点全部删除（如 <code>1→2→3→3→4→4→5</code> 变为 <code>1→2→5</code>），那里需要用到哨兵节点和&quot;前驱指针&quot;技巧，难度显著提升。建议先完全掌握本题，再挑战 LC #82。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 83 删除排序链表中的重复元素","id":"leetcode-83-删除排序链表中的重复元素"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 21 合并两个有序链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0021-merge-two-sorted-lists"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 141 环形链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0141-linked-list-cycle"}}